WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.190 --> 00:00:04.040
SCP-035 Vs SCP-049.

00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:07.760
An evil mask with frightening supernatural
powers against a plague doctor tragically

00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:09.590
cursed with a deadly touch.

00:00:09.590 --> 00:00:11.219
But who would win in a battle?

00:00:11.219 --> 00:00:13.269
Honestly, this is a tough one.

00:00:13.269 --> 00:00:19.050
Whether SCP-049 could kill one of 035’s
hosts with a deadly touch is an open question.

00:00:19.050 --> 00:00:23.720
However, it’s possible, if 035’s host
isn’t particularly strong, that a legion

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:26.750
of the Plague Doctor’s zombies may be able
to bum rush it.

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:31.690
The real question, and the one we’re having
trouble with, is whether SCP-035 could trap

00:00:31.690 --> 00:00:34.969
049 and convert him into another host.

00:00:34.969 --> 00:00:39.220
It all depends on the pliability of the mask:
Because if the mask is rigid, there’s a

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:44.050
good chance that 049’s unusual face shape
would save his life, and bag him the victory

00:00:44.050 --> 00:00:45.809
over 035.

